      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:74 OCP\\Config::js: the manual names no replacement event"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 connection to a legacy hook of the server. A hook the server removed is never emitted, and the listener never runs; the typed events of OCP\\EventDispatcher replace the hooks.",
        "OCP\\Util::connectHook() is deprecated since Nextcloud 21: use \\OCP\\EventDispatcher\\IEventDispatcher::addListener. ocp-deprecated leaves these calls to this finding.",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:74 OCP\\Config::js: the manual names no replacement event"
      ]
    },
